$\BPP\subseteq\R\bigcdot\coRP$ would hold by essentially the proof of $\BPP\subseteq\SigmaP{2}$ in \cite{lautemann83bpp} if we removed the implicit one-sided-error pseudodeterminism in the definition of $\R\bigcdot\coRP$. \cite{muchnik96general,buhrman99one} proved the relativized separation of the time complexity classes $\BPP\not\subseteq\RP^\RP$, but the proof doesn't yield $\BPP\not\subseteq\RP^\RP$ in query complexity. Proving the latter separation would be a first step toward proving $\BPP\not\subseteq\RP^\RP$ in communication complexity.

